{"schema": "smallest_sea.v1", "seed": 41, "parameters": {"captain": "Tom", "explorer": "Lily", "board_cm": 140, "gap_cm": 110, "board_sound": true, "daylight": false, "sticky_door": false, "pot_mass": 3, "tight_lid": false, "change_coat": false, "grab_whole": true, "map_upside_down": true}, "scene_count": 8, "path": ["launch", "enter_summerhouse", "lights", "exit_summerhouse", "crossing", "treasure", "share", "ending_together"], "story": "Tom stood by the back door in boots and a paper hat. \"I'm captain. You're the crew.\"\n\"Explorer,\" Lily said. \"I choose things too.\"\nMom brought a map. \"Treasure under the apple tree. No trampling my flowers.\" Lily took it.\n\"Even for treasure?\" Tom asked.\n\"Especially for treasure.\"\n\nOutside, they passed the summerhouse. Tom opened its door. \"A cave. We should explore it.\"\n\"The treasure's at the tree,\" Lily said.\n\"There might be two treasures.\"\nThey went inside. The shutters were closed. Tom switched on the light. A coat hung above an empty deckchair.\n\nTom switched off the light. \"A proper cave!\"\nThe coat became a tall shape. Lily caught a sleeve. \"Put it back on.\"\n\"It's only the coat.\"\n\"Then I want to see the coat.\"\nTom clicked the switch. \"Sorry.\"\nLily let go. \"Leave it on while I'm here.\"\n\n\"You can switch it off now,\" Lily said from the doorway. Tom turned out the light. They stepped into the garden and pulled the door shut. The latch clicked. Tom rattled the handle once to check. \"Cave secured.\"\nLily tucked the map under an arm. \"Off we go.\"\n\nA puddle covered the path to the apple tree. \"The sea,\" Tom said.\nLily helped lay a board across it, both ends resting on dry ground. They pressed it with their boots. It stayed firm.\n\"One at a time.\"\nThey crossed slowly. Neither boot touched the brown water.\n\nUnder the apple tree stood an upside-down flowerpot. Tom tugged at it. \"Help?\" Lily took the other side. Together they set it aside.\nLily picked up the biscuit tin underneath. Tom eased the lid open.\nInside were two ginger biscuits, one broken.\n\"Gold?\"\n\"Better. You can eat this.\"\n\n\"Captains get the whole one,\" Tom said. Lily stopped reaching.\nTom divided the broken pieces into two piles, then broke the whole biscuit and added half to each.\n\"Explorers get half.\"\n\"Half of which?\"\n\"Both.\"\nLily checked both piles. They ate beneath the dripping leaves.\n\nThey crossed the board again, carrying the empty tin. At home, boots came off and the tin went on the table. Tom offered Lily the paper hat. \"Captain tomorrow?\"\n\"Together.\" Lily put it on. \"But ask before making it dark.\"\n\"I will.\"\nThey spread the map between them on the sofa. Neither kept it on their own knee.", "episodes": [{"id": "launch", "before": {"party.location": "house", "party.route": "", "party.ended": false, "captain.goal": "", "captain.coat": "red", "captain.sleeve_wet": false, "captain.hands_wet": false, "captain.cooperation": 0, "captain.asked_help": false, "captain.clothing_decided": false, "explorer.requested_light": false, "red_coat.location": "captain", "green_jacket.location": "hook", "captain.role": "captain", "explorer.role": "explorer", "captain.will_ask": false, "explorer.afraid": false, "explorer.trust": 0, "explorer.bracing": false, "explorer.remembers_ship": false, "explorer.remembers_height": false, "party.boots_on": true, "map.owner": "mom", "map.read": false, "map.upside_down": true, "map.mark": "", "flag.location": "behind_boots", "hat.owner": "captain", "hat.wet": false, "hat.folded": false, "summerhouse.door_open": false, "summerhouse.light_on": false, "summerhouse.daylight": false, "summerhouse.dark": true, "summerhouse.sticky": false, "summerhouse.close_attempted": false, "summerhouse.apology": false, "summerhouse.light_tried": false, "board.length": 140, "puddle.width": 110, "board.sound": true, "board.location": "bank", "board.tested": false, "board.supported": false, "pot.mass": 3, "captain.strength": 2, "explorer